00││
01│  Welcome to Proqi, a prompt composer designed to replace common agent input methods. Capture, refine, organize, and│
02│  submit prompts here.│
03│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
04││
05│  Press Enter to edit the focused thought. Press Esc to return to board mode.│
06│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
07││
08│  Press n to create a new thought, or paste in board mode to create one from the pasted text.│
09│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
10││
11│  Use j or ↓ to move to the next thought, and k or ↑ to move to the previous one. Press d to delete the focused thought│
12│  and u to undo.│
13│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
14││
15│  Proqi works on its own. Herdr adds a power-user workflow for organized agent panes and verified adjacent submission│
16│  when a compatible agent is available. Learn more at https://herdr.dev│
17│  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
